{title: Yaad Kiya Dil Ne Kahan Ho Tum}
{artist: Hemant Kumar}
{key: Eb}

{c: Verse 1}
[Eb] [Ab],        Yaad kiya dil ne kaha ho tum
[Eb],        Jhumti bahar hai kaha ho tum
[Ab] [Bb],        Pyaar se pukar lo jaha ho tum
[Eb],        Pyaar se pukar lo jaha ho tum
[Eb],        O kho rahe ho aaj kis khayaal me
[Eb],        O dil fasa hai bebasee ke jaal me
[Eb] [Ab],        Matlabee jahan meherbaan ho tum
[Eb],        Yaad kiya dil ne kaha ho tum
[Ab] [Bb],        Pyaar se pukaar lo jaha ho tum
[Eb],        Pyaar se pukar lo jaha ho tum
[Eb],        O raat dhal chukee hai subah ho gayee
[Eb],        O mai tumhaaree yaad leke kho gayee
[Eb] [Ab],        Abb toh meree dastaan ho tum
[Eb],        Yaad kiya dil ne kaha ho tum
[Ab] [Bb],        Pyaar se pukaar lo jaha ho tum
[Eb],        Pyaar se pukar lo jaha ho tum
[Eb],        O tum hamaaree jindagee ke baag ho
[Eb],        O tum hamaaree raah ke charaag ho
[Eb] [Ab],        Mere liye aasmaan ho tum
[Eb],        Yaad kiya dil ne kaha ho tum
[Ab] [Bb],        Pyaar se pukaar lo jaha ho tum
[Eb],        Pyaar se pukar lo jaha ho tum
